      "text": "Citation File Format\n\n[](https://github.com/citation-file-format/citation-file-format/actions/workflows/testing.yml?query=branch%3Amain) [](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.1003149) [](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/) [](https://citation-file-format.github.io)\n\nThe Citation File Format lets you provide citation metadata for software or datasets  in plaintext files that are easy to read by both humans and machines.",
