    "data": {
      "text": "Validate your CFF file cffconvert --validate\n\nIf you get a Traceback with error messages, look for the relevant validation error and fix it. If the output is very long, it may help if you search it for lines starting with jsonschema.exceptions.ValidationError.\n\nIf you prefer to use Docker, you can use the [cffconvert Docker image] https://hub.docker.com/r/citationcff/cffconvert:\n\ncd  docker run --rm -v ${PWD}:/app citationcff/cffconvert --validate",
